          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "Attack a visible living player within 3 blocks to give them a pumpkin head for 15 seconds and gain one pumpkin. Each target has a 15-second cooldown; safe time prevents this. Their original helmet is returned.",
            "zh_cn": "你的体型缩小80%，且无法击杀其他玩家。",
            "zh_tw": "你的體型縮小80%，且無法擊殺其他玩家。"
